Description:
Quantum Power Asia is consolidating renewable energy assets and building new projects as we work closely with  our Clients and strategic partners across Asia. At the core of our strategy lies: 

•	Our commitment to delivering projects on time and within budget;
•	Our ability to proactively solve problems;
•	Our non-compromising commitment to excellence;
•	Our ability to inspire through achievement; and
•	Our commitment to meaningful sustainable development that creates a measurable return on investment.

The purpose of our work is to enable the development of profitable large-scale clean electricity projects throughout Asia. Our vision is to develop and manage a portfolio of assets that supports the goal of providing universal electricity access for all communities in the region.

For more information go to http://www.quantumpower.com.sg
